---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy">
  <section class="section paper">
    <article class="container narrow prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy & enquiries.</h1>
      <h2>What stays in your browser</h2>
      <p>
        The enquiry list and item notes are stored in your browser’s localStorage so they remain
        available while you browse the site. Clear the list or browser site data to remove them.
      </p>
      <h2>Sending a requirement</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit the form, the contact and requirement information you enter is recorded in
        SHK’s private enquiry system so the team can respond and follow up. The site also prepares a
        WhatsApp message with the same SHK enquiry reference. Opening WhatsApp shares the message
        with WhatsApp; you review and send it yourself. WhatsApp’s own privacy terms apply.
      </p>
      <h2>How SHK uses enquiry information</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry information is used for technical review, quotation, follow-up and customer
        communication. The private admin area is not indexed by search engines and requires SHK
        credentials.
      </p>
      <h2>Drawings and attachments</h2>
      <p>
        Selected files are not uploaded to this website or transferred through a WhatsApp link. Only
        their filenames are included in the generated message. Attach files yourself in the WhatsApp
        conversation.
      </p>
      <h2>Analytics and hosting</h2>
      <p>
        This build uses no analytics scripts or advertising cookies. The hosting provider may
        process ordinary request logs when the site is deployed.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a> about information
        you share with SHK.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
